    {
      "version": "0.3.1",
      "seq": 30199,
      "date": "2026-10-20T02:17:46Z",
      "created": "2026-10-20T01:31:20Z",
      "kind": "major",
      "prerelease": false,
      "notes": "First signed release through GitHub.\n\n- Over-the-air updates: signed releases, a health check and automatic rollback\n  (also after a power cut mid-update), manual \"go back\" from the key page.\n- Your settings and knob calibration live outside the release\n  (`/etc/hasler`); a calibration wizard for every knob on the key page.\n- Key page: Software card; installing, rolling back, Wi-Fi and reset need a\n  press on the radio; protection against malicious web pages.\n- Pilot lamp: one meaning per colour, smooth fades, night mode by the sun.\n- Boot: music about 15 s after power-on (was 40-60 s); YouTube Music plays its\n  first track from a cache; no music after a power cut at night.\n- yt-dlp updates weekly as its own user, with a self-check.",
      "channels": [
        "bench"
      ],
      "halted": [],
      "requires_migration": false,
      "min_from_seq": 0,
      "variants": [
